      "page_number": 1,
      "content": "Harbor handoff study\n\n1. Purpose\n\nThis synthetic study compares two inspection routes over six weekday trials.\n\nThe observations describe this sample only; weather and staffing were held constant.\n\n2. Findings\n\nTable 1 records median elapsed time and the number of missed handoffs.\n\nRoute        Median (min)     Missed handoffs\n\nCheck first       12                 1\n\nTest first        19                 3\n\nThe check-first route was faster by 7 minutes, but this is not a causal estimate.\n\nFigure 1. Gate order: check, test, then release; each gate must pass before the next.\n\n3. Limits\n\nThe trial excluded overnight operations and must not be generalized to storms.",
