      "content": "4. References\n\n[1] Harbor Lab. Handoff protocol, synthetic edition, 2026, sections 2-3.\n\n[2] Harbor Lab. Trial log, synthetic edition, 2026, entries 1-6.\n\nAppendix A. Observation rule\n\nA missed handoff means a parcel waited more than 5 minutes after its release signal.\n\nObservers recorded one timestamp per gate and did not change the route mid-trial.",
